        "chars": 651,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 989.36
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        247,
        1691,
        1784,
        2078
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "RESOLVED, that such reductions, pursuant to such Section 70-a, as so amended, in the contributions of members of such Retirement System in the employ of the Queens Borough Public Library, shall be made beginning with the payroll period commencing on April 1, 1965; it being the intent of this resolution that the reductions in the contributions of such members hereby provided, pursuant to L. 1965, c. 25, shall succeed without interruption, the reductions provided for such members, pursuant to L. 1964, chs. 185 and 186, by the resolution of this Board of Trustees approved by Executive Order #102 issued by the Mayor on May 27, 1964.",
